{"content":"It appears there is an issue with the JSON format. Let's simplify the calculation and ensure the JSON is correctly formatted.\n\nWe need to calculate the percentage of TDRs associated with commercial loans in 2012. The formula is:\n\\[ \\text{Percentage} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{TDRs associated with commercial loans}}{\\text{Total TDRs}} \\right) \\times 100 \\]\n\nUsing the values from the numeric catalog:\n- TDRs associated with commercial loans in 2012: $541 million (source: t2c1n0)\n- Total TDRs in 2012: $2859 million (source: t3c1n0)\n\nLet's calculate this using the `calculate` tool with a properly formatted JSON.\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Calculating the percentage of TDRs associated with commercial loans in 2012.\",\n  \"tool\": \"calculate\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"expression\": \"(541 / 2859) * 100\",\n    \"variables\": {\n      \"541\": {\"value\": 541, \"source\": \"source:t2c1n0\", \"unit\": \"million\"},\n      \"2859\": {\"value\": 2859, \"source\": \"source:t3c1n0\", \"unit\": \"million\"}\n    },\n    \"sources\": {\n      \"541\": \"source:t2c1n0\",\n      \"2859\": \"source:t3c1n0\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```","elapsed_seconds":10.636512408033013,"finish_reason":"stop","generated_token_count":349,"generated_token_ids":[2132,7952,1052,374,458,4265,448,279,4718,3561,13,6771,594,39721,279,21937,323,5978,279,4718,374,12440,23126,382,1654,1184,311,11047,279,11414,315,350,7687,82,5815,448,8353,16606,304,220,17,15,16,17,13,576,14806,374,510,78045,1124,1318,90,36167,92,284,1124,2359,7,1124,37018,35702,1318,76025,7687,82,5815,448,8353,16606,3417,35702,1318,90,7595,350,7687,82,3417,1124,1291,8,1124,15136,220,16,15,15,1124,2533,16429,279,2750,504,279,24064,16403,510,12,350,7687,82,5815,448,8353,16606,304,220,17,15,16,17,25,400,20,19,16,3526,320,2427,25,259,17,66,16,77,15,340,12,10657,350,7687,82,304,220,17,15,16,17,25,400,17,23,20,24,3526,320,2427,25,259,18,66,16,77,15,692,10061,594,11047,419,1667,279,1565,35597,63,5392,448,264,10277,23126,4718,